and the platform C toolchain; it does not use\nthe Go reference compiler.\n\nThe release contains exactly these assets:\n\n- `type-rb-native-bootstrap-root-qbe-v1.ssa`\n- `type-rb-native-bootstrap-darwin-arm64`\n- `type-rb-native-bootstrap-linux-arm64`\n- `type-rb-native-bootstrap-manifest-v1.json`\n- `SHA256SUMS`\n\nVerify the SHA-256 manifest and GitHub artifact attestations before using a\ncompiler asset. The machine-readable manifest records the exact source,\nTypeRB, QBE, target, size, digest, and release identities.\n\nSee the repository's bootstrap seed distribution decision and raw Gate 6L\nevidence for the complete trust boundary, fixed-point checks, process\ninventory, and measurements.\n"}